          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nndokonyi dimuuze kwa awa Waishmaeli, disem'bonye ilagho jingi angu uo ni mwanidu, bagha yedu cheni.” Waruna wikarumiria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Wamidiani wamu wa biashara waida aho, waruna wikaghenda na kumjosa Josefu kufuma kinenyi, wikamuuza kwa Waishmaeli kwa shekeli mirongo iwi ra feza, na Waishmaeli wikamdwa noko cha Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
